<h1>System Menu</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>The System menu gives access to various system settings. This menu is divided in 2 sections:</p>
<table cellspacing="0" class="whs4">
<col class="whs5">
<col class="whs6">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="215px" class="whs8">
<p><img src="../images/system_menu.gif" width="273px" height="232px" border="0" class="img_whs9" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td valign="middle" width="305px" class="whs10">
<table cellspacing="0" width="100%" class="whs11">
<col class="whs12">
<tr valign="top" class="whs13">
<td valign="middle" width="100%" class="whs14">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="#Settings_group">Settings group</a></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td valign="middle" width="100%" class="whs14">
<p><a href="#PC">Utilities group</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Settings_group"></a>Settings group</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="800" class="whs16">
<col class="whs17">
<col class="whs18">
<col class="whs19">
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="16.708%" class="whs21">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="73.833%" class="whs22">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="9.375%" class="whs23">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs24">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="16.708%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Hardware Settings</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.833%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table">Calls the Hardware dialog. The options in it depends on the sensor connected to the scanning system. Currently available are:</p>
<p class="normal-table">MMD -<a href="../Scanning/Hardware/MMD/Settings/hardware_settings_mmd.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a>; &#160;&#160;MMZ -<a href="../Scanning/Hardware/MMZ/Settings/hardware_settings_mmz.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a>; &#160;&#160;MMX -<a href="../Scanning/Hardware/MMX/Settings/hardware_settings_mmx.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a>; MMC -<a href="../Scanning/Hardware/MMC/Settings/Hardware_Settings_MMC.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs28" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs30">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="16.708%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Preferences</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.833%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table">Calls the Preferences dialog.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/display_settings.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs31">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="16.708%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Reset Software Settings</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.833%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table">Sets all software settings to their default values.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Reset_Software_Settings.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs32">
<td width="16.708%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Shortcut Keys</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.833%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table">Calls the Shortcut Keys dialog.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="Shortcut_Keys.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="PC"></a>Utilities group</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="800" class="whs33">
<col class="whs34">
<col class="whs35">
<col class="whs36">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="105px" class="whs37">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="564px" class="whs38">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="53px" class="whs39">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">PC Diagnostics</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">To check the specification of your PC against the requirements of KUBE. The information displayed can be stored as a text file and sent to your local Marketing Partner to assist in fault-finding.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/PC_Diagnostics.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Sensor Calibration</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">Starts the sensor calibration procedure.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table">-</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Localiser Menu Operation</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table"><img src="../images/localiser_menu_operation_submenu.gif" width="351px" height="50px" border="0" class="img_whs43" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func">Calibrate</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">Calls the Localiser Menu operation dialog, that helps you calibrate the localiser for working with scan menu.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="localiser_menu_operation.htm"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func">Settings</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">Calls the Localiser Menu Settings dialog.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="Localiser_Menu_Settings.htm"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func">Alignment</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">Starts the Alignment procedure.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../Scanning/Alignment/Alignment_Procedure.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func">Performance Check Utilities / Capture</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table"><img src="../images/PCU_Capture_submenu.gif" width="474px" height="69px" border="0" class="img_whs44" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func">Static Points</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">Enables capture single points mode.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../Scanning/Probe_Points_Capture/capture_static_points.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func">Dynamic Points</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">Enables capture sets of points mode.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../Scanning/Probe_Points_Capture/capture_dynamic_points.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func">Static Stripes</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">Enables capture single stripes mode.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../Scanning/Probe_Points_Capture/capture_static_stripes.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func">Performance Check Utilities / Measure</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table"><img src="../images/PCU_Measure_submenu.gif" width="551px" height="68px" border="0" class="img_whs45" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func">Parallel Planes (Manual)</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">Fits a plane to the selection and a second plane to all the unselected data. The distance between the two planes is calculated.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/fit_parallel_planes_(manual).htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func">Multiple Lines</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">Fits a line through each stripe in scan data and calculates statistics.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/fit_multiple_lines.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="105px" class="whs40">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Multi-Site</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="564px" class="whs41">
<p class="normal-table">Lets you load/save the Multi-Site scanning state.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="53px" class="whs42">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../Scanning/Scanning/Multisite/multisite_scanning_intro.htm" target="_self"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
